	(text "GPIO3 STRAP + BMI270 INT1 - AUDITED FBV2-S1-005\n\nR18 220R SERIES. NO PULL ON THIS SHEET.\nTHE STRAP IS DEFINED BY R110 10k PULL-DOWN, SHEET 02.\n\nBOOT SAFETY - PROVEN, NOT ASSUMED:\nINT1_IO_CTRL RESET = 0x00 -> OUTPUT DISABLED.\nINT1 IS HIGH-Z UNTIL FIRMWARE ENABLES IT, WHICH\nCANNOT HAPPEN BEFORE THE 8 kB CONFIG UPLOAD.\nESP32-S3 STRAP HOLD TIME tH = 3 ms MIN.\nTHE IMU CANNOT REACH THE STRAP WINDOW.\n\nFIRMWARE CONTRACT - MANDATORY:\n  INT1_IO_CTRL.od  = 0   PUSH-PULL\n  INT1_IO_CTRL.lvl = 1   ACTIVE HIGH\nOPEN-DRAIN IS FORBIDDEN HERE. IT CANNOT DRIVE\nAGAINST R110 PULL-DOWN AND NO EDGE WOULD APPEAR.\n\nGPIO3 = RTC_GPIO3, SO EXT0/EXT1 DEEP-SLEEP WAKE\nWORKS. ACTIVE-HIGH INTO A PULL-DOWN IS THE\nCORRECT WAKE POLARITY FOR WAKE-ON-MOTION.\n\nBMI270 PAD DRIVE IOH/IOL <= 2 mA, VOH >= 0.8*VDDIO.\nLOAD = 3.3 V / 10.22k = 323 uA. 6x MARGIN. B-44 CLOSED.\n\nLAND PATTERN VERIFIED AGAINST DS SECTION 8.3.\nDO NOT BURN EFUSE_STRAP_JTAG_SEL WITHOUT\nREASSESSING THIS CIRCUIT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.968 141.732 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "64a7d195-5d5c-43e9-8524-5f4fd70fdf6e")
	)
	(text "INTERNAL I2C BUS - AUDITED FBV2-S1-005\n\nONE PULL-UP PAIR ONLY: R19 / R20 TO +3V3.\n4.7k -> 2.2k (D-139). NO OTHER PULL-UP MAY BE\nFITTED ON THIS NET. R49 / R50 BELONG TO THE\nSWITCHED ACCESSORY SEGMENT ON SHEET 09.\n\nWORST-CASE BUS LOAD ~85 pF:\n  ESP32-S3 5, U2 10, U3 10, U4 5, U14 10,\n  U16 A-SIDE 13, J1 + CTP FLEX 18, TP 2, TRACE 12\n\nt_r = 0.8473 * R * C\n  4.7k -> 338 ns   FAILS THE 300 ns Fm LIMIT\n  2.2k -> 158 ns   PASSES WITH 47% MARGIN\nSINK = 1.32 mA AT VOL 0.4 V, INSIDE EVERY DEVICE\n(BMI270 2 mA, TCA9535 SDA 6 mA, I2C SPEC 3 mA).\n\nBRING-UP AT 100 kHz, THEN 400 kHz.\n\nRESERVED ADDRESSES - DO NOT DUPLICATE:\n  0x20 U2    0x21 U3    0x36 U14   0x38 CTP\n  0x68 U4    0x50 ACCESSORY ID EEPROM (EXTERNAL)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.688 106.934 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a2877568-7cdc-4376-acb6-31da6aab2389")
	)
